1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,574
Your phone can see a light your eyes cannot.

2
00:00:03,074 --> 00:00:06,449
Point your TV remote at the camera and press a button.

3
00:00:06,949 --> 00:00:08,123
The tip lights up.

4
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:10,535
That's infrared light, just past red.

5
00:00:11,035 --> 00:00:12,744
Your eyes fade out at red.

6
00:00:12,744 --> 00:00:14,847
The camera's sensor keeps going.

7
00:00:15,347 --> 00:00:15,918
No glow?

8
00:00:15,918 --> 00:00:17,488
Try the selfie camera.

9
00:00:17,488 --> 00:00:20,271
Rear cameras often filter infrared out.

10
00:00:20,771 --> 00:00:22,463
Bluetooth remotes won't show it.

11
00:00:22,763 --> 00:00:25,960
But most TV remotes have been glowing at you all along.
